+---
+id: task-005-cancel-rental-bookings
+type: task
+title: "Cancel rental bookings"
+status: approved
+format: 1
+---
+
+Add `cancel(bookingId, at)` to the rental service. It must release the booked equipment and return
+the booking ID together with a refund for the unused portion of the booking's already-discounted
+total. A booking may only be cancelled once.
